      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nI'm working on a camera system for VRChat, and it's very annoying to have these red lines every time I accidentally open the menu in my recordings.\n\nIf you have a layer for players that does not contain this red lines it would be very useful\n\nI'm sure this would be useful for any and all custom camera systems",
