  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In VRChat, when you open the quick menu, an red indicator is shown on other players' cameras\n\nthe problem is that this indicator is on the Player layer\n\nThe correct behavior would be for this indicator to be on the UIMenu layer\n\nI haven't tested it on other platforms but this behavior probably also occurs on them too",
